<title>USA: Freddie Mac to redeem debenture issue.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac to redeem debenture issue.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp said Monday that on December 12 it will redeem the entire $25 million principal amount of its 7.41 percent debentures due June 12, 2001. The debentures have  cusip number 3134AOR95.</p>
<p>Freddie Mac said it will redeem the issues in their entirety at a price equal to 100 percent of principal. It will pay principal plus accrued interest to the redemption date to holders of record as of the close of business on December 11.</p>
</text>
